%% Fishing controller state machine (shared by admittance & force-feedback)

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> MONITOR: node start (t=0)

    MONITOR --> HOOK_SET: t ≥ bite_time (default 2.4 s)
    note right of MONITOR
        Hold q_init pitch.
        No tension regulation.
        Admittance: f_desired = 0
    end note

    HOOK_SET --> REGULATE: t ≥ bite_time + hook_duration (default 1.2 s)
    note right of HOOK_SET
        Smoothstep sweep q_init → q_hook.
        Simulates hook-set motion.
    end note

    REGULATE --> REGULATE: control loop
    note right of REGULATE
        Track target_tension (default 3.5 N).
        Admittance: virtual mass-spring-damper.
        Force-feedback: asymmetric P mapping.
    end note

    REGULATE --> ESTOP: |tension| > safety_tension_limit
    note left of ESTOP
        Hold last safe position.
        Log warning once.
    end note

    ESTOP --> REGULATE: tension back in range
